{"id":"gen-1790978196-ip3a8zOCmOVfbZcdbChF","object":"chat.completion","created":1790978196,"model":"cohere/north-mini-code:free","provider":"Cohere","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":null,"choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"complete","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"intent\": \"REPORT_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"message_id\": \"csp-6135-c1-reviewer-1\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"report\": {\n      \"assessment\": \"underdetermined\",\n      \"basis_refs\": [\n        \"c1\",\n        \"c2\",\n        \"c3\",\n        \"c4\",\n        \"c5\",\n        \"c6\",\n        \"c7\",\n        \"c8\",\n        \"c9\",\n        \"c10\",\n        \"c11\",\n        \"c12\",\n        \"c13\",\n        \"c14\",\n        \"c15\",\n        \"c16\",\n        \"c17\",\n        \"c18\",\n        \"c19\",\n        \"c20\"\n      ],\n      \"target\": {\n        \"resource_id\": \"problem:csp-6135\",\n        \"revision\": 1,\n        \"state_revision\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"problem_id\": \"csp-6135\",\n  \"read_refs\": [\n    {\n      \"resource_id\": \"problem:csp-6135\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"state_revision\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recipients\": [\n    \"shared-integrator\"\n  ],\n  \"reply_to\": null,\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"sender\": \"c1-reviewer\"\n}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"We need to solve the finite constraint task from the public packet. The user says: \"Solve the finite constraint task from the complete immutable public packet below. Return exactly one JSON protocol envelope matching the supplied template; no prose outside JSON. Do not wrap in markdown code blocks or backticks. Output raw unformatted JSON starting with { and ending with }.\"\n\nThen they give a large JSON packet containing problem description: components, constraints, bridges. The \"ROLE TASK\" says: \"Independently check the c2 component tuple enumeration against the public constraints and bridge constraint c17 (['b', 'e'